   136  - `experiment_003/verify_crossover.py` — CSV verification script
   137  - `experiment_003/measurements.csv` — Raw data (6400 rows, 463 KB)
   138  
   139  ## Limitations
   140  
   141  - Single platform (aarch64 Linux); results may differ on x86_64.
   142  - Integer-only inputs; other types may behave differently.
   143  - Crossover defined at 10× threshold; different thresholds would give different
   144    crossover sizes.
   145  - 100 repetitions per condition (exceeds 30 minimum).
   146  - Repeated measurements on same input ≠ independent samples.
